\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Controlled reconstruction workflow. Each axis is normalised, encoded, and stored as an 8-bit image channel, then decoded in its method-specific normalised domain and optionally returned to physical units with per-axis calibration. The lower box expands the method-specific decoder $\mathcal  D_m$.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
