\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {7}{\ignorespaces Subject-level classification equivalence under grouped subject-out validation. The primary family comprises 18 simultaneous subject-cluster bootstrap intervals (six classifiers by RP/GASF/GADF); the six MTF negative-control comparisons form a separate family (51 subjects, \(10^4\) joint resamples per family). For each method, ``most boundary-near'' is the single simultaneous interval whose endpoint lies closest to the equivalence margin, with the classifier it comes from; all 24 individual intervals are in the Supplementary Material.}}{12}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:equivalence_ci}{{7}{12}{}{}{}}
